<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Bulk Tiger - 120,000 tonnes coal Roberts Bank/Iskenderun $14 fio 40,000 shinc/16,000 shinc 20-30/4 Fording Coal.</p>
<p>ORE - TBN - 120,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Kaohsiung $9.65 fio 40,000 shinc/38,000 shinc 15-30/5 China Steel.</p>
<p>Thios Mitsos - 70,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Ghent $8.70 fio five days shinc 19-29/4 Sidmar.</p>
